rson in this community is like a cell in the immune system of a healthy human body."}]},"229777":{"renderings":[{"id":"4b052711d8ca8897","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"67139"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"In a way, life is a cruel thing. It holds major problems in store for each one of us."}]},"330779":{"renderings":[{"id":"413904407e0ecb54","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"330523"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"So let us summon a new spirit of patriotism, of responsibility, where each of us resolves to pitch in and work harder and look after not only ourselves but each other."}]},"776970":{"renderings":[{"id":"5880f06625f96f99","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"777005"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"I think that everyone has to make efforts to save nature."}]},"1018765":{"renderings":[{"id":"a38c6eced4ca0210","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba","ref":"1018767"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Every child who learns, and every man who finds work, and every sick body that's made whole - like a candle added to an altar - brightens the hope of all the faithful."}]}}}